                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The MAGA Republican budget cuts: \n\u00a0\nMedicaid \u2013 14 million Americans would lose health coverage\n\nSNAP \u2013 when 80% of SNAP households include a child, senior, or disabled person\n\nScam protections \u2013 just days after Hoosier families were victims of a phishing scheme\n\u00a0\nI\u2019m voting NO.",
