                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "You\u2019ve heard about how the Republican budget bill will decimate Medicaid. But you may not know how that will impact our hospitals \u2013 and everyone\u2019s ability to get emergency healthcare, even if you\u2019re not on Medicaid. \n\nLet\u2019s break it down:",
